      "x": 80,
      "y": 162,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 76,
      "text": "Step 1  Add New Key\nUser: oldPrivKey → newPubKey, nullifier, deactivate leaf Merkle path\nProof: hash binding, nullifier, deactivate leaf, Merkle inclusion, re-randomization\nContract: ✓ nullifier unused  ✓ program hash  ✓ FactRegistry  →  state_commitment=new, keys_added=1",
