      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_s2",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 284,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 76,
      "text": "Step 2  Process Deactivate\nOperator: decrypt 3 msgs → witness → Atlantic proof\nProof: STARK ECDH, STARK decrypt relation, STARK ECDSA, active+deactivate tree update\nContract: ✓ deactivate continuous  ✓ state continuous  ✓ FactRegistry  →  deactivate_commitment=new",
