      "x": 80,
      "y": 406,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 76,
      "text": "Step 3  Process Messages\nOperator: decrypt 3 vote msgs (reverse order) → update state tree → Atlantic proof\nProof: STARK ECDH, STARK decrypt, STARK ECDSA, state transition, deactivate match\nContract: ✓ state continuous  ✓ deactivate continuous  ✓ FactRegistry  →  state_commitment=new",
