      "x": 80,
      "y": 528,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 76,
      "text": "Step 4  Tally\nOperator: read final state tree → compute vote count → Atlantic proof\nProof: state Merkle, vote root match, quadratic formula, stateCommitment link\nContract: ✓ tally_submitted==false  ✓ tally continuous  ✓ state continuous  ✓ FactRegistry  →  tally_commitment=new, done",
